  (31, 'Rowan Naththarampatha', 'rowannath26@gmail.com', 'rowannn.n', 'Environmental Student / Geology, Art, Nature', 'Research', 'I want to volunteer to gain valuable experience and insights that will strengthen my portfolio and own knowledge, as well as working towards making a difference in the way science is viewed and engaged with by the general public. I have loved science since I was a kid, and I have experience in volunteering on small nature reserves. I am competent in research and written communication skills.', '2026-08-16 19:53:40'),
